Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:59.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗彻福德夫人 王后一定满心欢喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How happy her Majesty must be, Lady Rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:02.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看她整日莺歌燕舞 喜不自胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems to me she does nothing but dance and rejoice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.07,0:02:05.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀先生 她笑逐颜开 这理所当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has every reason to be happy, Mr. Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.69,0:02:07.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她集国王万千宠爱于一身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King spoils her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他几乎每日都为她购置华服宝饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Almost every day he buys her new dresses or jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:13.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想尽万般方法讨她欢心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems he cannot treat her well enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:16.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜国王也同样春风满面吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I presume the King is also very happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.70,0:02:18.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下简直如获新生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty seems like a new man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:23.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他清晨五点多就起床 七点做弥撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He rises between 5 and 6 am, attends Mass at 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:25.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一大早骑马打猎 十点回宫就餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}rides out early to hunt, comes back at 10 for dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:27.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下午处理朝政\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and attends to business in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:30.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他是意欲保持旺盛精力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think his new rule of living is intended to keep him fit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.91,0:02:32.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能心领神会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:37.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他想取悦她 就得练就强健体魄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I suppose he would needs be fit, if he wants to satisfy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她魅力四射 引人注目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is very... appealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:47.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀先生 她只是个傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's just a fool, Mr. Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:51.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个天真烂漫的小傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A sweet little fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:58.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗彻福德夫人 你近况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How about you, Lady Rochford?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:01.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乔治·博林故去已有时日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's been some time since George Boleyn's death;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:03.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你还未曾改嫁 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You've not remarried? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:25.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 萨福克公爵求见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Duke of Suffolk, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:29.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯 我要给你看样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles, I have something I want to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:33.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我刻了枚纪念章 以此铭记我的婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've had a medal struck to commemorate my marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:40.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]"亨利八世: 至我无刺的玫瑰"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Henricus VIII: Rutilands rosa sine spina."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:42.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"你是我无刺的玫瑰"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"My rose without a thorn."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:46.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克里维斯的安近况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me: how is Anne of Cleves?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:50.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她已定居新宅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe she has settled into her new estates,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.11,0:03:52.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并对陛下的仁慈慷慨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and shows every sign of being grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.45,0:03:54.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}满怀感激之情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your Majesty's charity and generosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.05,0:03:58.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还获悉 她同陛下的女儿们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I also understand that she has maintained her relationships
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:00.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍时相过从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with your Majesty's daughters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:04.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}常邀她们一起用餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and often asks them to dine with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.69,0:04:07.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莱斯利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Risley.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:10.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 写信给安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Majesty. - We shall write to the Lady Anne
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:12.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢她让我们得偿所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to thank her for being so conformable,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并向她保证 若她保持此道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to assure her that if she continues in this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:16.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将视她为挚友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she will find in us a perfect friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:19.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并尊她为我最挚爱的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}content to repute her as our dearest sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:20.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵旨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:27.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人对你的态度有所改观吗 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does the Duchess love you any better, Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:29.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看似如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She seems to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:32.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但只是表面文章罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but only for the sake of appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:41.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当如何帮你 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How can I help you Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:45.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}待她欲再次与我行房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, when she consents to make love to me again...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:48.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}造一枚勋章以示纪念吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}strike a medal to commemorate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:06.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 萨里大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- My Lady. - My Lord Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:09.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直期待着您的来信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had rather trusted to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:10.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:15.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上次我们共进晚餐时 你让我以为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When we supped together, you gave me to suppose that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:17.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:19.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:27.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以为什么 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That I what, my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:30.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以为你会施恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That you would oblige me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:33.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}满足我的欲望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and accommodate my desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:46.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果让你有此误会 那么非常抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I gave you that impression I am truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:48.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并无此意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was far from my intention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:50.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我侍寝吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sleep with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.22,0:05:58.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您不知我是何人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:01.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:05.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那您可知家夫是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you know who my husband is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:08.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 他是西摩家的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes I do! He's a Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:13.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}彼之家族如狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His family are wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:16.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾之家族则似虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mine are lions!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉 我的追求太低了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me for aiming so low!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:31.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 陛下要见您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord, his Majesty wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:39.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赫福德伯爵参见陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Earl of Hertford, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.77,0:06:47.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真希望我能和你们一样欢快舞蹈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish I could go dancing like all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.53,0:06:50.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要音乐响起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whenever I hear the music,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:53.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尘世一切繁务便一下子微不足道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel like nobody has a care in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:57.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看这些公文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look at my cares!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:02.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾有一人 能帮我打点好一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had someone once who could take care of all of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.49,0:07:03.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他已不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now he's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.53,0:07:05.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾儿可好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:09.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华王子一切安好 健康茁壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Prince Edward is very well. He is a strong and healthy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.81,0:07:11.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不辱他父王的荣光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He does his father proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:11.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:15.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他定能很快成为其他王子的楷模\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trust he will soon be followed by other princes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:22.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我另有任务给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm making you a new appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:27.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将封你为中将 出使北方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm making you Lieutenant General to the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}近日多有逆贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Recently, there's been too many incursions
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:31.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从苏格兰向我大英进犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}over the border from Scotland into England.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:34.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要你面见我的表亲 苏格兰之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to deal with my cousin, the King of the Scots,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.71,0:07:36.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他下令停止进犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I want these incursions stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:38.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如若不然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he does not stop them,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:40.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明确授命于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you have our express permission
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:43.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大举进犯他国国界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to harry and persecute the people on his side of the border
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:46.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直至你觉得合适为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with as much aggression and as much force as you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:48.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:55.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果时机合适 我也许会和詹姆士国王会晤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We might, in time, meet our cousin, King James.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}众所周知 他也许是大智若愚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For all we know, he may not be as stupid as he appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:07:59.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:03.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我责成你去确保苏格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am trusting you to ensure that the Scots cease their...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.06,0:08:08.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停止他们的无礼之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}impertinence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:17.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天啊 继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh God, oh fuck me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:18.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:22.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续 别停 用力…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, fuck me... oh yes... oh yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:25.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 凯瑟琳 - 啊 爽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Oh, Katherine! - Oh yes... oh yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.66,0:08:27.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}oh God...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:29.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh just fuck me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:46.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续 再多说点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go on! Tell me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:49.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我答应她不会外传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I promised her I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:53.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的琼 你可以对我知无不言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dearest Joan, you can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.73,0:08:56.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我负责一切与王后有关的事宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm responsible for everything to do with the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:58.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我得知道一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, I have to know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:00.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样我才能保护她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That way, I can protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:05.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以 你俩受公爵夫人庇护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So... when you both lived at Lambeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:07.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住在朗伯斯的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}under the protection of the Duchess,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:09.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到底发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what exactly happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:13.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有两个护花使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There were these two Gallants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:17.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个叫弗朗西斯·迪尔罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were called Frances Dereham
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:19.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一个叫爱德华·瓦德格拉夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Edward Waldegrave,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:23.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是伯爵夫人的随从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who was a Gentleman in Waiting upon the Duchess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:25.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:29.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夜深人静之时 他们会设法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they found a way to call, secretly, at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:31.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与凯瑟琳和我幽会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon Katherine and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:35.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整晚流连于我们床榻之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And they would lie in our beds all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:38.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和沃尔德格雷夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You with Waldegrave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:40.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳和那位弗朗西斯·迪尔罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Katherine with this Francis Dereham?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.09,0:09:43.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 正是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. That's how it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:46.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两位先生待你们如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what would these gentlemen do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:09:57.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人说闲话吗 无人知晓吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Didn't anyone say anything? Didn't they find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:02.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若说是迪尔罕待她如妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, if Dereham used her as a man doth his wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:07.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不过是她自以为和他有白首之盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it was only because she thought herself already betrothed to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:08.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仿佛约定俗成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like on a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:11.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的情史可不短\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It went on between them a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:24.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有 你会保密的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Still, you won't tell anyone, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:26.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你绝不透露半点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You won't say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:29.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她要我发誓保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She made me swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:34.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会守口如瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I won't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:39.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早安 真是个好天气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good morning! It's a lovely day today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:41.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走开 别挡路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on! Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.34,0:10:43.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你乱看什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:45.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要八加仑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take a bushel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:52.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}滚开 你这贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clear out of here, you fucking slut!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:55.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What in God's name are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:59.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来见识下真正的女人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Starin' at a real woman, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.87,0:11:02.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在看什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:11.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人好身手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good sport my Lord, good sport!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:13.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太过分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ain't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:21.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 萨里伯爵因妨害公共秩序罪被关押\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Earl of Surrey has been jailed for public disorder, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伯爵仍坚称自己为"上帝之鞭"吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Earl maintained he was the scourge of God?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:25.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:29.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还把伦敦称作"不知羞的婊子"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And called London itself "a shameless whore"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.01,0:11:31.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 他的确这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. He did indeed so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对大斋节时开荤一事作何解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about eating meat during Lent?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:42.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说自己有权例外 只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He told us he had a licence to do so. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:45.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但说无妨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.31,0:11:48.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加德纳主教怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bishop Gardiner suspects
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:51.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨里伯爵所食之肉是在万圣堂附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my Lord Surrey of obtaining his meat on the black market,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:53.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通过蜜巷集市的新教徒屠夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from some evangelical butchers in Honey Lane,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:55.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从黑市上购得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}near the church of All Hallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 这间万圣堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This same church, your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:12:00.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也有散播异教邪说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is suspected by some of secretly sowing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.01,0:12:02.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窝藏路德异教徒之嫌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and setting forth Lutheran heresies,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.90,0:12:05.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更有甚者 蓄意藐视斋戒律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and of deliberately flouting the fasting laws. Pound it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:09.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真没想到萨里是个异教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never thought Surrey could be a heretic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:12.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他父亲像是个天主教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His father is closer to a Papist...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.70,0:12:14.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少在我面前装得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}although to my face, he pretends otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:17.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若陛下恩准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Grace and I would be inclined,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.49,0:12:18.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾等臣子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with your Majesty's permission,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:21.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿对伯爵之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to examine the Earl more closely
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:23.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进行深入彻查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on these fundamental matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:28.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们想借机打压吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to torture him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:45.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 马上放了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Release him, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:58.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要开始筹备新年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should make plans for the New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:12:59.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:03.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想宣玛丽公主进宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would like to invite the Lady Mary to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还想邀请克里维斯的安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd also like to invite Anne of Cleves
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}参加新年宴会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for New Year's celebrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.93,0:13:11.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿过来 系紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring that through. Fasten it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:13.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 到这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's it. Bring it around this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:14.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two rods!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:28.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们 这是国王赏赐的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady, here are your presents from the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:34.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是礼物啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Presents!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.41,0:13:38.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:45.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看呐 多鲜亮 闻闻看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look! So shiny! Smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:49.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玫瑰花香 真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Smells of roses! It's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:52.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太漂亮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:00.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后 看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.99,0:14:03.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王宠如此隆厚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty spoils you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know he does!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道我不值得他如此相待吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But am I not worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:16.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摸摸看 柔软无比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Feel it, it's so soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:23.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是英国王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am the Queen of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:26.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是金子 我爱金子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh gold! I love gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:31.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这与我的裙子很配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It goes with my dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:37.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 圣诞快乐 女士们 - 圣诞快乐 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Happy Christmas, Ladies. - Happy Christmas, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.35,0:14:40.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们这是要去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:41.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有更多礼物呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are more presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.49,0:14:42.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:52.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}意下如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太漂亮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:59.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是克里维斯的安所赠之礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were sent ahead by Anne of Cleves as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.31,0:15:00.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她将于明日抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She arrives tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:02.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克里维斯的安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne of Cleves?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:06.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我邀她前来共度新年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. I've invited her for New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:08.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不会介意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't mind, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:11.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然不会介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, of course I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:13.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣妾悉听陛下吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty must do as you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:24.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你觉得我会喜欢她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But...will I like her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:26.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个克里维斯的安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this Anne of Cleves?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.23,0:15:28.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明日自会知晓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:36.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但愿玛丽公主高雅华贵胜过昔日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope the Lady Mary will be more gracious than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.99,0:15:44.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}众位大人 玛丽公主驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lords, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:04.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.71,0:16:08.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾之爱女 玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My beautiful daughter, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:12.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向王后请安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Say hello to the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:19.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.26,0:16:23.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽公主 见你再次回宫 我欣喜不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Mary. I am very glad to see you back at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:25.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢陛下所赠厚礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you for my gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:28.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}依然一如既往阔绰大方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty, as always, is more than generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:30.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.38,0:17:06.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.89,0:17:08.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:17.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我犹记您当年授我牌艺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember that you once taught me to play cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.01,0:17:19.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直心存感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am very grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:22.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多亏您的教导 让我收获颇丰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As a result of your tuition, I have won a fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:30.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:32.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克里维斯的安女士驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Anne of Cleves!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:51.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Anne,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:55.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎来我宫中一聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}welcome to my court.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:17:59.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty! Happy Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:03.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请让我为你介绍我的新妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Allow me to introduce to you my new wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:04.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Queen Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.21,0:18:05.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:07.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:12.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能瞻仰陛下容颜 实属三生有幸 无上荣光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What a great privilege and honour it is for me to be presented to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.99,0:18:15.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我实在难掩激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am so delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:18.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的到来 我们欢迎之至 安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are very welcome to court, Lady Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.77,0:18:21.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您所赠汗血宝马 我们甚为感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We thank you so much for the two fine horses you sent,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:24.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并祝愿您来年顺心愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and wish you a very happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:26.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 王后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:29.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窃以为我们当共同祝愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think we should all be merry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:30.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正合吾意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:48.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ladies. Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:51.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你身体不适吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are not well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.89,0:18:55.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}近日身受痛风困扰 玛丽公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These days I suffer a little from gout, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:57.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 快请坐吧 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Please sit. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:09.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一直是我最信任的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are and always have been my most faithful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.47,0:19:12.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}忠贞可靠 当世无人能及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and truest friend in all this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你如要离去 我实在无法承受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not bear it if you were ever to leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.34,0:19:28.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不该与安女士离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He ought not to have divorced the Lady Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:31.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并非我与她相交更深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now that I know her better,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.11,0:19:33.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为她甜美可人 雍容华贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think she is perfectly sweet and gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.80,0:19:35.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管如此 玛丽公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nevertheless, Lady Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:39.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕您还是要与新王后建立友好的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear that you will have to reconcile yourself to the new Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.23,0:19:41.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐难为止 我讨厌她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I will not. I hate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:48.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许我的建议于您而言犹如鸿毛 无足轻重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then, perhaps, after all, you do not require my advice any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.52,0:20:10.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 不知您可有家兄爱德华的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady, I wanted to ask if you had any news of my brother Edward?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.30,0:20:12.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:16.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}身受寒气所侵 潮气所扰 但依然安好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cold, but well. Wet, but well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:20.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然 北部冷雨频繁 淤泥随处皆是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apparently, it always rains in the north, and the mud is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.98,0:20:22.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知他有何动作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will he see some action?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:25.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他一定会猛击苏格兰人的痛处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe he intends to punish the Scots for their terrible wickedness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:28.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听上去确属家兄作风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That sounds very like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.81,0:20:31.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可惜在这方面你不及他 托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If only you could be more like him, Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:33.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}何出此言呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.73,0:20:38.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}余之夫君 心之所想 志在必得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My husband always takes what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:48.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们 失陪一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ladies, you must forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:51.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我今日早起外出打猎 略感疲惫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I rode out early to hunt this morning and am very tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:54.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明日 我们再共进晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall dine again together tomorrow evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.55,0:20:56.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 安女士 - 是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Lady Anne. - Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.54,0:20:57.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我美丽的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My beautiful wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:02.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留下来 尽情享受舞会的快乐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, I must insist you stay to enjoy the dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:05.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:07.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:14.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:20.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿大家尽兴 新年快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bid you all a good night. Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.87,0:21:23.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}新年快乐 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Happy New Year, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.39,0:21:37.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安女士 需要添些酒吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder... will you have some more wine, Lady Anne?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:39.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下如此建议 我荣幸之至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With pleasure, if Your Majesty will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:41.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.41,0:21:42.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}添酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:46.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下 请用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:47.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.49,0:21:50.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安女士 请用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:59.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下曾透露 伊丽莎白公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty tells me that his daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.53,0:22:02.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时而会去探望你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Lady Elizabeth, sometimes comes to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:07.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得她如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:10.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迷人极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, she is charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.49,0:22:12.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}聪明美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So clever. And so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:14.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}惹人怜爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And so very affectionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:16.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与她见面 总令人心情愉悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is always a pleasure to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.25,0:22:26.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不欲再嫁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see, I have no desire to remarry,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.63,0:22:29.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此 膝下便无儿女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so I am sure I will never have any children of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.37,0:22:34.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小伊丽莎白 如女儿般贴心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think a little that Elizabeth is like a daughter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.57,0:22:36.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相较之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely it is so
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.99,0:22:39.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比起王后之位 如此乖巧伶俐的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to have had her as a daughter would have been
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:43.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带给我更多欢愉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a greater happiness to me than ever being Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:00.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.50,0:23:24.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:42.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能问陛下一个问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I ask Your Majesty a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.91,0:23:44.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.11,0:23:49.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下为何邀请克里维斯的安女士赴宴呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did Your Majesty invite Lady Anne of Cleves for Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.60,0:23:58.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对她 我心有怜惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I like her, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.72,0:24:01.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是言而有信之人 小卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She keeps her promises, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.93,0:24:27.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下 请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty? Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.39,0:25:48.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}琼·布尔默偷偷告诉你什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, what did this Joan Bulmer tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.54,0:25:54.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She said that
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.68,0:25:58.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天夜里 迪尔罕会潜入凯瑟琳的香闺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the nights Dereham visited Katherine's bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.49,0:26:03.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时而带些美酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he would bring with him wine,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.02,0:26:05.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}草莓 苹果 或其他小食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}strawberries, and apples,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.83,0:26:10.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}二人宴飨尽饮 好不乐乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and other things to make good cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.84,0:26:14.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.08,0:26:20.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.75,0:26:34.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么样呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.86,0:26:39.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}激情热吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There would be kissing
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.61,0:26:46.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宽衣解带 翻云覆雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and...he would pull down his hose and lie down with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.86,0:26:49.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莺歌燕舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the two of them would
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.14,0:26:53.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如胶似漆 共赴巫山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hang by their bellies like two sparrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.64,0:27:09.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来拿啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:13.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莺歌燕舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the two of them would hang by
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.84,0:27:16.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如胶似漆 共赴巫山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}their bellies like two sparrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.21,0:27:36.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为何在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.03,0:27:39.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如家兄一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Taking what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.95,0:27:42.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夺取吾心所欲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just like my brother does.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.47,0:27:45.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他擅长如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just like he's always done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.02,0:27:52.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若我拒绝呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what if I don't want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.33,0:27:55.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若我唤来侍卫呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if I call my servants?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.48,0:27:58.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不会 知道为什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You won't. And you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.07,0:28:03.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我们是一类人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because you hate my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.41,0:28:07.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你恨我哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You hate him almost as much as I hate him
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.75,0:28:10.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但除我之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but you can't tell anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.19,0:28:12.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你根本无处诉苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}except me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.71,0:29:01.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 西摩先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, Mr. Seymour,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.71,0:29:07.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就寝吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}come into my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.21,0:29:16.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敬请细细品味汝兄之物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enjoy what your brother enjoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.52,0:29:19.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相较之下 定当妙趣横生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will be interesting to compare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.76,0:29:28.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我信唯一的上帝 我万能的父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Credo in unum Deum patris omnipotentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.09,0:29:32.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我信唯一的上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Credo in unum Deum patris
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.40,0:29:33.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我万能的父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Patris omnipotentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.91,0:29:37.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公主殿下 王后驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady! My Lady! The Queen is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.98,0:29:56.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 王后陛下 - 玛丽公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your Majesty - Lady Mary
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.87,0:30:01.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本宫亲临到此 是想问你为何不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have come here in person to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.23,0:30:04.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对作为英格兰王后的本宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why you will not show me the respect which as Queen of England
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:07.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施以合乎尊卑礼数的敬重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am entitled to expect even from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.31,0:30:10.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我早就注意到 和其他人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I noticed, as did everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.51,0:30:12.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们都对克里维斯的安女士相当敬重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you show the greatest respect to the Lady Anne of Cleves,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.89,0:30:16.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而并不在乎她现在微不足道的身份与地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even though she is now just a private person and worth no account.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.62,0:30:18.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恕我冒昧 可是安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me. But surely the Lady Anne is
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.93,0:30:21.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实值得我们每个人敬重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}worthy of every respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.26,0:30:23.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她举止雅贵 仪态雍容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She carries herself with great dignity
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.60,0:30:25.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}端庄贤淑 秀外慧中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and also modesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.72,0:30:29.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且她一心侍奉陛下 别无他图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and desires nothing more than to please the King her Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.56,0:30:32.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说我没有尽心侍奉陛下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you mean I do not try to please him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.02,0:30:34.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得您除了玩乐享闲 亦无他求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you desire almost nothing else than pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.73,0:30:36.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}终日只知锦衣华扮 嬉闹宫闱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It pleases you, it seems, to do nothing but wear
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.93,0:30:38.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}秀舞寻欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}pretty clothes and dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.11,0:30:41.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}众人虽觉得这种行为轻浮放浪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some people may think that frivolous,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.51,0:30:44.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无奈君王伴偶的身份却覆之以伪圣的外衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the consort of a King whose flesh is also sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.47,0:30:47.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倘若陛下认为我轻浮放浪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If his Majesty thought me only frivolous,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.51,0:30:49.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又为何要纳我入宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did he marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.83,0:30:55.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}母以子贵 陛下看重的是您的生育能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are thought capable of bearing sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.60,0:30:58.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是所有君王的相同之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unfortunately, for all the King's attentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.70,0:31:01.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可我看您至今仍未怀有身孕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see you are still not pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.39,0:31:04.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此下去 陛下迟早会冷落你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In any case, he will soon tire of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.93,0:31:06.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走着瞧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.86,0:31:12.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你又怎么样呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.60,0:31:17.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.18,0:31:19.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得你不过是妒火中烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you're jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.36,0:31:22.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你嫉妒我 因为你年老色衰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're jealous because you're much older than me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.54,0:31:25.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却依然待字闺中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you're still not married.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.59,0:31:31.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}闺深夜长 等着做一辈子老处女吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you'll never be married, and will grow old a maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.81,0:31:37.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么敢对我如此出言不逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How dare you speak to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.69,0:31:41.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就是敢 因为我有权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I dare because I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.59,0:31:46.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的权力还远不止这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I can do something else, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.07,0:31:51.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于对你失敬于本宫的惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As punishment for your lack of respect towards his Majesty's wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.39,0:31:54.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要削减你身边的两名侍女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am removing two of your maids from your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.02,0:31:56.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你好运 玛丽女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A good day to you, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.11,0:32:19.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敬与挚爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here's to love.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.99,0:32:23.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敬与凯瑟琳 英格兰王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To Katherine, Queen of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.11,0:32:27.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑 你们不久便能喜得龙种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And, God willing, may you soon be ripe with children.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.03,0:32:30.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常感谢 你们两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you. Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.08,0:32:34.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真是仁慈可人 安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are so kind, Lady Anne
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.07,0:32:37.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有我温慈的陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and my gracious lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.72,0:32:45.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这辈子永远都是最快乐的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am the most happy I have ever been in my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.81,0:32:49.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有礼物送给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.00,0:33:00.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.01,0:33:04.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能看看吗 王后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I please see it, your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.12,0:33:11.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么 还有惊喜吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, what's this? Not more presents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.60,0:33:13.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喜欢吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.07,0:33:15.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱死它们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I just adore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.30,0:33:17.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.27,0:33:25.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 可是… - 怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Oh! But... - But?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.96,0:33:28.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下可否准许我与安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With your Majesty's permission, I would like
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.00,0:33:31.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}分享这份礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to share these gifts with the Lady Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.89,0:33:34.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和我吗 还是别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With me?! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.09,0:33:37.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.81,0:33:39.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.89,0:33:42.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:44.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.68,0:33:45.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它们是你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.67,0:33:50.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 感谢你 凯瑟琳 - 新年快乐 安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Thank you, Katherine! - Happy New Year, Lady Anne,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.47,0:33:54.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好吗 小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.34,0:33:59.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看它有多可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello. Isn't he sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.10,0:34:11.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.13,0:34:12.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您这是干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.84,0:34:14.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要回汉斯顿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going back to Hunsdon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.64,0:34:16.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您得到陛下的准许了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you asked his Majesty's permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.87,0:34:19.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您为何要离去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.69,0:34:21.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没听说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Haven't you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.28,0:34:23.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她要削减掉我两名侍女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has removed two of my maids!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.51,0:34:26.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.46,0:34:29.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是因为我没对她表现出足够的敬重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apparently I don't treat her with sufficient respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.69,0:34:32.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士 请听我说 我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, please. I am sure if you found some
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.81,0:34:34.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您只需稍费心思以抚悦一下王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}small means to conciliate the Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.04,0:34:37.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那样您的侍女们就能获准留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then the maids would probably be allowed to remain...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.65,0:34:39.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 为何我要如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.36,0:34:41.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不愿向她示好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't want to conciliate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.11,0:35:03.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她对您说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did she say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.15,0:35:06.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She said...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.84,0:35:09.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说我嫉妒她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I'm jealous of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.53,0:35:14.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为她已成婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because she is married
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.51,0:35:18.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我却没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.99,0:35:28.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且我永远也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And may never be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.02,0:35:31.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不该说这些话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She ought not to have said such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.78,0:35:36.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 可她说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, but they're true!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.07,0:35:40.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千真万确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're true!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.93,0:36:06.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My sweet Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.49,0:36:10.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可怜的好小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My poor sweet Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.34,0:36:24.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗彻福德夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.11,0:36:34.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下今日可好 卡尔佩珀先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is the King today, Mr. Culpepper?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.95,0:36:36.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下今日十分安好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is very well,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.90,0:36:38.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他让我转达他的爱意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sends you his love and
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.24,0:36:40.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并希望您得到妥善的照顾和款待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hopes you are well looked after and entertained?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.50,0:36:44.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今日我本想去骑马 可天公不作美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanted to go riding today but the weather was too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.40,0:36:46.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm very sorry to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.60,0:36:54.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下希望您了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty wants you to know
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.66,0:36:56.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我军对苏格兰的战役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the military campaign against the Scots has
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.89,0:37:00.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大获全胜 他对赫福德大人十分满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}been a great success, and he is most pleased with Lord Hertford
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.53,0:37:03.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也对在那里奋战的其余将领十分满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his other Captains, who performed well in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.64,0:37:06.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which field?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.40,0:37:08.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是指在战场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It means the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.41,0:37:11.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很欣慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.77,0:37:15.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 欣慰 - 他们在战场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Glad? - That they did so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.14,0:37:17.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}表现如此卓越\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.41,0:37:26.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有事么 卡尔佩珀先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there anything else,Mr. Culpepper
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.75,0:37:34.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 是的 这本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, yes. This book.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.76,0:37:37.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这本书是由一位理查德·琼斯所著\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was written by one Richard Jonas,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.94,0:37:39.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是克里维斯的安夫人的随行人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who came here to England in the train of Anne of Cleves,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.74,0:37:41.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然他本想把此书敬献给他的女主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and obviously meant to dedicate it to his mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.62,0:37:43.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但现在 若能得陛下您的垂青\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now,with your Majesty's permission,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.99,0:37:45.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他愿将此书敬献给您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he would like to dedicate it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.77,0:37:48.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么书 给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it? Give it me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.28,0:37:55.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人类的起源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"The Byrthe of Mankind"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.90,0:37:57.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这应该是第一本由英文撰写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe it's the first major work
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.46,0:37:59.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于助产学的书籍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on midwifery to be written in English.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.16,0:38:00.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}助产学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Midwifery?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.97,0:38:18.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}琼斯先生希望将此书献给最仁慈善良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Jonas would now like to dedicate it to the most gracious
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.00,0:38:22.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}优秀卓越 品德高尚的凯瑟琳王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and in all goodness, most excellent, virtuous lady, Queen Katherine
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.94,0:38:42.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh! Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.87,0:39:01.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道那是什么感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder what it would feel like?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.06,0:39:03.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What what would feel like?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.36,0:39:05.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想象着 带上美酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I suppose I should go down to her with wine,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.93,0:39:07.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苹果和草莓去找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}apples, and strawberries,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.77,0:39:09.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管那些东西在此季节已难寻觅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}although they are all out of season.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.75,0:39:12.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是在说谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.38,0:39:15.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who do you think I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.05,0:39:21.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莺歌燕舞 如胶似漆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hanging by their bellies like two sparrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.06,0:39:39.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你真的想要吗 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Do you really want to? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.04,0:39:46.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若你真想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.10,0:39:51.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能替你安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could arrange it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.76,0:40:13.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.53,0:40:25.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 感谢上帝 公爵大人 - 怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Thank God, your Grace! - What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.07,0:40:27.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来 快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come. Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.65,0:40:31.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}情况有多糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.24,0:40:32.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵大人 陛下腿上的溃疡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace, the ulcer on his
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.91,0:40:35.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不幸再次阻塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty's leg has unfortunately become clogged again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.52,0:40:36.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们别无他法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have no option but to
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.60,0:40:39.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只能割开伤口挤去已积脓液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}drain off the fluid which has collected there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.28,0:40:42.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则 只怕陛下性命堪忧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Otherwise-we fear for his Majesty's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.13,0:40:53.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me, Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.44,0:41:19.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此次非比平常 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is worse than ever before, your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.00,0:41:21.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若是陛下驾崩将会如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happens if the King should die?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.22,0:41:24.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们要向上天祈求陛下能挺过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your race must pray to heaven that he does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.37,0:41:26.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可他的情况令人堪忧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he looks likely to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.47,0:41:29.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最担心的莫过于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.27,0:42:10.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人们 我对你们大失所望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lords, I assure you that I am not content.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.98,0:42:12.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾给予你们信赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have relied upon you
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.63,0:42:16.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}委汝为我出谋划策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to inform and counsel me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.17,0:42:19.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而 我却受到生生地欺骗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and yet I am the most deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.68,0:42:24.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对诸位如此信任 宠爱有加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have trusted and favoured all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.97,0:42:31.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可如今心生疑窦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have formed a sinister opinion...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.56,0:42:35.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们全都满嘴谎话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that most of you are liars
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.52,0:42:40.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只顾溜须拍马 谋求一己私利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and flatterers who look only to your own profits.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.26,0:42:43.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道尔等居心何在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know what you are plotting.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.25,0:42:46.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若神能助我一臂之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if God gives me the strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.69,0:42:49.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必定教你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see to it that none
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.34,0:42:54.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阴谋挫败 一事无成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of your projects ever succeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.73,0:42:58.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔之死令我扼腕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mourn Cromwell's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.24,0:43:02.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我悲痛不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes! I mourn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.04,0:43:07.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我察觉到手下臣子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mourn him now that I perceive my Councillors,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.00,0:43:12.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}捏造事实 以莫须有的罪名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by light pretext, and by false accusations,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.32,0:43:19.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}害我处决了最忠诚的仆从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}made me put to death the most faithful servant I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.96,0:43:33.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.09,0:43:51.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 卡尔佩珀先生求见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty, Mr. Culpepper is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.11,0:43:54.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢天谢地 我能见陛下了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank God! May I see his Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.97,0:43:58.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉 王后 陛下依然龙体欠安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me, my Lady, but his Majesty remains indisposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.77,0:44:02.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他让我转达对您的爱 并以此表明心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sends you his love and this as a token of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.20,0:44:05.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢陛下 不过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thank his Majesty, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.61,0:44:08.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下已有十天之久未曾召见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is ten days since I have been allowed into his presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.14,0:44:11.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他到底为何不愿见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why will he not see me? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.48,0:44:15.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可有触怒龙颜 冒犯圣意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have I offended him in some way? What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.59,0:44:17.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他定然不再爱我如前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He cannot love me so much
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.65,0:44:20.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则怎会不闻不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if he can so easily neglect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.30,0:44:24.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许陛下早已移情别恋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps he has taken a mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.60,0:44:28.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是否另结新欢 卡尔佩珀先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has he taken a mistress, Master Culpepper?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.03,0:44:31.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以才不召见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that why he won't see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.03,0:44:35.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 恕难奉告 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot answer your Majesty. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.53,0:44:38.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们此刻在一起吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he with his mistress now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.94,0:44:46.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 既然你执意不讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well. You may go, since you will not tell me anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.00,0:44:51.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}眼看我伤心绝望 那就退下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even though you see how unhappy and miserable I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.86,0:44:55.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我愿意为您赴汤蹈火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know I would do anything in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.27,0:44:57.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在所不辞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.84,0:45:00.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要您顺心遂意 笑颜常开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to bring you comfort and make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.66,0:45:04.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怡然自在 世所钦羡 您生当如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More than any other woman, you deserve to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.43,0:45:53.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀先生英俊潇洒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Culpepper is so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.86,0:45:59.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他爱上您了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.77,0:46:05.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱上我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In love?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.25,0:46:09.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 他亲口坦承\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. He has confessed everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.17,0:46:13.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他告诉我 他爱得神魂颠倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He loves you madly. He told me so. He said
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.05,0:46:16.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至愿为您献出生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he would happily die for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.70,0:46:19.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对您日夜牵挂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that he thinks and dreams of you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.65,0:46:21.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朝思暮想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.19,0:46:50.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨里作了一首有关我们的诗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surrey has written a poem about us,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.02,0:46:52.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在宫中广为传播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which is circulating the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.16,0:46:53.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有关我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}About us?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.95,0:46:57.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诗中怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.79,0:46:59.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他称您为狼女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He calls you the wolf lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.81,0:47:01.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他当然就是狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naturally, he is the lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.15,0:47:03.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说您设套诱捕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He says you tried to entrap him
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.86,0:47:07.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但高贵的野兽 绝不会受制于奸佞之徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he is too noble a beast to be tangled by such cunning hooks!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.74,0:47:10.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还警告 如果您再敢图谋不轨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He also warns you that if you should cross his path again,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.72,0:47:13.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就让您打雁不成 反遭啄眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he will feed on you as you meant to feed on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.24,0:47:21.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还说我们杀害无辜 借此飞黄腾达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, and he says that we rose high by murdering the innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.05,0:48:27.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我愿意为您赴汤蹈火 在所不辞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know I'd do anything in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.16,0:48:34.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要您顺心遂意 笑颜常开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}anything...to bring you comfort and make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.18,0:48:40.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怡然自在 世所钦羡 您生当如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More than any other woman, you deserve to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.65,0:49:17.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想单独会见您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants to visit you. Privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.77,0:49:18.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.68,0:49:23.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.91,0:49:29.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这怎么行 不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He can't! That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.91,0:49:32.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course he can!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.67,0:49:36.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是有人半夜会过您吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just like that other one coming to you at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.19,0:49:41.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你都知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.66,0:49:43.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.81,0:49:45.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}琼·布尔默告诉了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Joan Bulmer told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.03,0:49:49.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这次也可如法炮制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it can be just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.02,0:49:51.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝对保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A secret.
